    "label": "thm:gp_bandit_info_gain",
    "number": "Theorem (thm:gp_bandit_info_gain)",
    "quote": "Consider the Gaussian process bandit defined above with Gaussian noise of variance $\\sigma^2$. Then, for all $T\\ge 1$, all agents $\\pi$ and all $D \\ge 1$, \\infoGain{T}{\\pi} \\le \\frac{1}{2}D\\log(1+\\frac{T}{\\sigma^2D}) + \\frac{\\delta_D T}{2\\sigma^2}. Consequently, if $\\delta_D \\to 0$ ... \\sup_{\\pi}\\infoGain{T}{\\pi} = o(T)."
   },
